Scope note (please read before redistributing):

The MIT license above covers the ORIGINAL content of this repository: the
SKILL.md review methodology, the export/build scripts, and the file
structure.

The distilled strategy records in references/strategies.db are paraphrases
and short attributed quotes from third-party works (talks, essays, blog
posts, books). They are redistributed under the fair-use-shaped form
described in references/sources.md, not under MIT. The underlying works
remain the property of their authors — consult the registry there before
further redistributing quoted material, and never redistribute raw source
texts through this repository.
